{"identifier":"TimeSave1936","title":"Time Savers for House Makers","description":"Screen ad for instant laundry starch.","videoUrl":"https://archive.org/download/TimeSave1936/TimeSave1936_512kb.mp4","thumbnailUrl":"https://archive.org/services/img/TimeSave1936","sourcePageUrl":"https://archive.org/details/TimeSave1936","durationMs":58001,"level":"C2","topic":"Advertising: Screen ads;Home economics: Laundry;Starch","sourceCredit":"Source: Internet Archive — Time Savers for House Makers","hasCaptions":true,"segments":[{"startMs":2000,"endMs":4000,"text":"Hello, everybody. Brooks Henderson speaking."},{"startMs":5000,"endMs":8001,"text":"Looks like a snowstorm we're having, but the cameraman was so interested he came up too close."},{"startMs":9000,"endMs":11000,"text":"Hey, let the audience see what it really is."},{"startMs":11000,"endMs":17000,"text":"Not snow, but fine downy powder. It's starch, a quick self-cooking starch, ready in no time at all."},{"startMs":17001,"endMs":22001,"text":"Watch. She moistens it first with lukewarm water. No wax to add. The glider is in the powder."},{"startMs":22001,"endMs":27000,"text":"It's a complete starching mixture. Now add steaming hot water from faucet or kettle."},{"startMs":28001,"endMs":34000,"text":"No boiling, no cooking, no need to skim or strain. Simply stir and perfect hot starch is ready."},{"startMs":35001,"endMs":40000,"text":"Now look, see how the four secret ingredients in quick elastic make ironing easy."},{"startMs":40001,"endMs":43001,"text":"No sticking, no scorching. Your iron fairly glides."},{"startMs":44001,"endMs":50000,"text":"Do all your starching this wonderful new way. Things look and feel like new, fresh and fragrant."},{"startMs":50000,"endMs":51000,"text":"They wash easily."},{"startMs":52000,"endMs":58001,"text":"For easy starching for beautiful ironing, ask your grocer for quick elastic starch. Large package, ten cents."}]}